{"real": false, "dur": 159.27, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 3.48, "text": "Chinese has no articles and no verb conjugations.", "words": [{"w": "Chinese", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "has", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "no", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "articles", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "and", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "no", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "verb", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "conjugations.", "s": 3.09}]}, {"start": 3.83, "end": 8.06, "text": "What it does have is measure words, aspect markers and tones.", "words": [{"w": "What", "s": 3.83}, {"w": "it", "s": 4.21}, {"w": "does", "s": 4.6}, {"w": "have", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "is", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "measure", "s": 5.75}, {"w": "words,", "s": 6.13}, {"w": "aspect", "s": 6.52}, {"w": "markers", "s": 6.9}, {"w": "and", "s": 7.29}, {"w": "tones.", "s": 7.67}]}, {"start": 8.41, "end": 13.02, "text": "But you can still use the same five categories for both languages.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 8.41}, {"w": "you", "s": 8.79}, {"w": "can", "s": 9.18}, {"w": "still", "s": 9.56}, {"w": "use", "s": 9.95}, {"w": "the", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "same", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "five", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "categories", "s": 11.48}, {"w": "for", "s": 11.87}, {"w": "both", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "languages.", "s": 12.64}]}, {"start": 13.37, "end": 16.83, "text": "In fact, I’d argue they work for any language.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 13.37}, {"w": "fact,", "s": 13.76}, {"w": "I’d", "s": 14.14}, {"w": "argue", "s": 14.53}, {"w": "they", "s": 14.91}, {"w": "work", "s": 15.3}, {"w": "for", "s": 15.68}, {"w": "any", "s": 16.07}, {"w": "language.", "s": 16.45}]}, {"start": 17.18, "end": 20.26, "text": "What changes is how important each one is.", "words": [{"w": "What", "s": 17.18}, {"w": "changes", "s": 17.57}, {"w": "is", "s": 17.95}, {"w": "how", "s": 18.34}, {"w": "important", "s": 18.72}, {"w": "each", "s": 19.11}, {"w": "one", "s": 19.49}, {"w": "is.", "s": 19.88}]}, {"start": 20.61, "end": 24.07, "text": "French and Mandarin overlap on vocabulary and sentence structure.", "words": [{"w": "French", "s": 20.61}, {"w": "and", "s": 21.0}, {"w": "Mandarin", "s": 21.38}, {"w": "overlap", "s": 21.77}, {"w": "on", "s": 22.15}, {"w": "vocabulary", "s": 22.53}, {"w": "and", "s": 22.92}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 23.3}, {"w": "structure.", "s": 23.69}]}, {"start": 24.42, "end": 26.35, "text": "Both use subject, verb, object.", "words": [{"w": "Both", "s": 24.42}, {"w": "use", "s": 24.81}, {"w": "subject,", "s": 25.19}, {"w": "verb,", "s": 25.58}, {"w": "object.", "s": 25.96}]}, {"start": 26.7, "end": 33.62, "text": "Look at these two sentences: “I go skiing” and “I drink coffee.” They’re built almost the same way.", "words": [{"w": "Look", "s": 26.7}, {"w": "at", "s": 27.08}, {"w": "these", "s": 27.47}, {"w": "two", "s": 27.85}, {"w": "sentences:", "s": 28.23}, {"w": "“I", "s": 28.62}, {"w": "go", "s": 29.0}, {"w": "skiing”", "s": 29.39}, {"w": "and", "s": 29.77}, {"w": "“I", "s": 30.16}, {"w": "drink", "s": 30.54}, {"w": "coffee.”", "s": 30.93}, {"w": "They’re", "s": 31.31}, {"w": "built", "s": 31.7}, {"w": "almost", "s": 32.08}, {"w": "the", "s": 32.47}, {"w": "same", "s": 32.85}, {"w": "way.", "s": 33.23}]}, {"start": 33.97, "end": 37.82, "text": "In French, word endings do a lot of the work.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 33.97}, {"w": "French,", "s": 34.35}, {"w": "word", "s": 34.74}, {"w": "endings", "s": 35.12}, {"w": "do", "s": 35.51}, {"w": "a", "s": 35.89}, {"w": "lot", "s": 36.28}, {"w": "of", "s": 36.66}, {"w": "the", "s": 37.05}, {"w": "work.", "s": 37.43}]}, {"start": 38.17, "end": 45.09, "text": "In Chinese, sounds and vocabulary matter much more, and word order does a lot of the grammatical work.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 38.17}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 38.55}, {"w": "sounds", "s": 38.93}, {"w": "and", "s": 39.32}, {"w": "vocabulary", "s": 39.7}, {"w": "matter", "s": 40.09}, {"w": "much", "s": 40.47}, {"w": "more,", "s": 40.86}, {"w": "and", "s": 41.24}, {"w": "word", "s": 41.63}, {"w": "order", "s": 42.01}, {"w": "does", "s": 42.4}, {"w": "a", "s": 42.78}, {"w": "lot", "s": 43.17}, {"w": "of", "s": 43.55}, {"w": "the", "s": 43.93}, {"w": "grammatical", "s": 44.32}, {"w": "work.", "s": 44.7}]}, {"start": 45.44, "end": 48.13, "text": "So let’s go through the five categories.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 45.44}, {"w": "let’s", "s": 45.82}, {"w": "go", "s": 46.21}, {"w": "through", "s": 46.59}, {"w": "the", "s": 46.98}, {"w": "five", "s": 47.36}, {"w": "categories.", "s": 47.75}]}, {"start": 48.48, "end": 51.17, "text": "Sounds carry a huge amount of weight.", "words": [{"w": "Sounds", "s": 48.48}, {"w": "carry", "s": 48.87}, {"w": "a", "s": 49.25}, {"w": "huge", "s": 49.63}, {"w": "amount", "s": 50.02}, {"w": "of", "s": 50.4}, {"w": "weight.", "s": 50.79}]}, {"start": 51.52, "end": 54.22, "text": "Tones matter from the very first day.", "words": [{"w": "Tones", "s": 51.52}, {"w": "matter", "s": 51.91}, {"w": "from", "s": 52.29}, {"w": "the", "s": 52.68}, {"w": "very", "s": 53.06}, {"w": "first", "s": 53.45}, {"w": "day.", "s": 53.83}]}, {"start": 54.57, "end": 58.41, "text": "Get the tone wrong and you’ve said a different word.", "words": [{"w": "Get", "s": 54.57}, {"w": "the", "s": 54.95}, {"w": "tone", "s": 55.33}, {"w": "wrong", "s": 55.72}, {"w": "and", "s": 56.1}, {"w": "you’ve", "s": 56.49}, {"w": "said", "s": 56.87}, {"w": "a", "s": 57.26}, {"w": "different", "s": 57.64}, {"w": "word.", "s": 58.03}]}, {"start": 58.76, "end": 62.22, "text": "Look at this example: one syllable in four tones.", "words": [{"w": "Look", "s": 58.76}, {"w": "at", "s": 59.15}, {"w": "this", "s": 59.53}, {"w": "example:", "s": 59.92}, {"w": "one", "s": 60.3}, {"w": "syllable", "s": 60.68}, {"w": "in", "s": 61.07}, {"w": "four", "s": 61.45}, {"w": "tones.", "s": 61.84}]}, {"start": 62.57, "end": 64.11, "text": "Mother, hemp, horse, scold.", "words": [{"w": "Mother,", "s": 62.57}, {"w": "hemp,", "s": 62.96}, {"w": "horse,", "s": 63.34}, {"w": "scold.", "s": 63.73}]}, {"start": 64.46, "end": 65.62, "text": "Four separate words.", "words": [{"w": "Four", "s": 64.46}, {"w": "separate", "s": 64.85}, {"w": "words.", "s": 65.23}]}, {"start": 65.97, "end": 69.04, "text": "In French, a pronunciation mistake usually gets forgiven.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 65.97}, {"w": "French,", "s": 66.35}, {"w": "a", "s": 66.73}, {"w": "pronunciation", "s": 67.12}, {"w": "mistake", "s": 67.5}, {"w": "usually", "s": 67.89}, {"w": "gets", "s": 68.27}, {"w": "forgiven.", "s": 68.66}]}, {"start": 69.39, "end": 72.08, "text": "In Chinese, a tone mistake often won’t.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 69.39}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 69.78}, {"w": "a", "s": 70.16}, {"w": "tone", "s": 70.55}, {"w": "mistake", "s": 70.93}, {"w": "often", "s": 71.32}, {"w": "won’t.", "s": 71.7}]}, {"start": 72.43, "end": 74.36, "text": "Vocabulary is another big challenge.", "words": [{"w": "Vocabulary", "s": 72.43}, {"w": "is", "s": 72.82}, {"w": "another", "s": 73.2}, {"w": "big", "s": 73.59}, {"w": "challenge.", "s": 73.97}]}, {"start": 74.71, "end": 77.78, "text": "There are almost no cognates to help you.", "words": [{"w": "There", "s": 74.71}, {"w": "are", "s": 75.09}, {"w": "almost", "s": 75.48}, {"w": "no", "s": 75.86}, {"w": "cognates", "s": 76.25}, {"w": "to", "s": 76.63}, {"w": "help", "s": 77.02}, {"w": "you.", "s": 77.4}]}, {"start": 78.13, "end": 85.44, "text": "And because of the characters, every word has to be learned twice: once by ear and once in writing.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 78.13}, {"w": "because", "s": 78.52}, {"w": "of", "s": 78.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 79.29}, {"w": "characters,", "s": 79.67}, {"w": "every", "s": 80.06}, {"w": "word", "s": 80.44}, {"w": "has", "s": 80.83}, {"w": "to", "s": 81.21}, {"w": "be", "s": 81.6}, {"w": "learned", "s": 81.98}, {"w": "twice:", "s": 82.37}, {"w": "once", "s": 82.75}, {"w": "by", "s": 83.13}, {"w": "ear", "s": 83.52}, {"w": "and", "s": 83.9}, {"w": "once", "s": 84.29}, {"w": "in", "s": 84.67}, {"w": "writing.", "s": 85.06}]}, {"start": 85.79, "end": 89.25, "text": "Word forms, on the other hand, are much simpler.", "words": [{"w": "Word", "s": 85.79}, {"w": "forms,", "s": 86.18}, {"w": "on", "s": 86.56}, {"w": "the", "s": 86.95}, {"w": "other", "s": 87.33}, {"w": "hand,", "s": 87.72}, {"w": "are", "s": 88.1}, {"w": "much", "s": 88.48}, {"w": "simpler.", "s": 88.87}]}, {"start": 89.6, "end": 96.14, "text": "Aspect particles do some of the work that tense endings do in French, without the conjugation tables.", "words": [{"w": "Aspect", "s": 89.6}, {"w": "particles", "s": 89.99}, {"w": "do", "s": 90.37}, {"w": "some", "s": 90.76}, {"w": "of", "s": 91.14}, {"w": "the", "s": 91.53}, {"w": "work", "s": 91.91}, {"w": "that", "s": 92.3}, {"w": "tense", "s": 92.68}, {"w": "endings", "s": 93.07}, {"w": "do", "s": 93.45}, {"w": "in", "s": 93.83}, {"w": "French,", "s": 94.22}, {"w": "without", "s": 94.6}, {"w": "the", "s": 94.99}, {"w": "conjugation", "s": 95.37}, {"w": "tables.", "s": 95.76}]}, {"start": 96.49, "end": 98.42, "text": "But sentence structure matters enormously.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 96.49}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 96.88}, {"w": "structure", "s": 97.26}, {"w": "matters", "s": 97.65}, {"w": "enormously.", "s": 98.03}]}, {"start": 98.77, "end": 103.77, "text": "With little inflection, grammar relies on word order, topic and comment, and particles.", "words": [{"w": "With", "s": 98.77}, {"w": "little", "s": 99.15}, {"w": "inflection,", "s": 99.53}, {"w": "grammar", "s": 99.92}, {"w": "relies", "s": 100.3}, {"w": "on", "s": 100.69}, {"w": "word", "s": 101.07}, {"w": "order,", "s": 101.46}, {"w": "topic", "s": 101.84}, {"w": "and", "s": 102.23}, {"w": "comment,", "s": 102.61}, {"w": "and", "s": 103.0}, {"w": "particles.", "s": 103.38}]}, {"start": 104.12, "end": 106.81, "text": "Look at the pair of sentences here.", "words": [{"w": "Look", "s": 104.12}, {"w": "at", "s": 104.5}, {"w": "the", "s": 104.88}, {"w": "pair", "s": 105.27}, {"w": "of", "s": 105.65}, {"w": "sentences", "s": 106.04}, {"w": "here.", "s": 106.42}]}, {"start": 107.16, "end": 108.7, "text": "It’s a classic example.", "words": [{"w": "It’s", "s": 107.16}, {"w": "a", "s": 107.54}, {"w": "classic", "s": 107.93}, {"w": "example.", "s": 108.31}]}, {"start": 109.05, "end": 110.2, "text": "Here’s something interesting.", "words": [{"w": "Here’s", "s": 109.05}, {"w": "something", "s": 109.43}, {"w": "interesting.", "s": 109.82}]}, {"start": 110.55, "end": 114.01, "text": "Measure words give Chinese its own kind of agreement.", "words": [{"w": "Measure", "s": 110.55}, {"w": "words", "s": 110.93}, {"w": "give", "s": 111.32}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 111.7}, {"w": "its", "s": 112.09}, {"w": "own", "s": 112.47}, {"w": "kind", "s": 112.86}, {"w": "of", "s": 113.24}, {"w": "agreement.", "s": 113.63}]}, {"start": 114.36, "end": 120.52, "text": "In French, every noun has a gender, and the article and adjective have to match it.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 114.36}, {"w": "French,", "s": 114.75}, {"w": "every", "s": 115.13}, {"w": "noun", "s": 115.52}, {"w": "has", "s": 115.9}, {"w": "a", "s": 116.28}, {"w": "gender,", "s": 116.67}, {"w": "and", "s": 117.05}, {"w": "the", "s": 117.44}, {"w": "article", "s": 117.82}, {"w": "and", "s": 118.21}, {"w": "adjective", "s": 118.59}, {"w": "have", "s": 118.98}, {"w": "to", "s": 119.36}, {"w": "match", "s": 119.75}, {"w": "it.", "s": 120.13}]}, {"start": 120.87, "end": 123.94, "text": "In Chinese, every noun has its own classifier.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 120.87}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 121.25}, {"w": "every", "s": 121.63}, {"w": "noun", "s": 122.02}, {"w": "has", "s": 122.4}, {"w": "its", "s": 122.79}, {"w": "own", "s": 123.17}, {"w": "classifier.", "s": 123.56}]}, {"start": 124.29, "end": 130.45, "text": "Here you’ve got a photo, a bottle and a room, and each takes a different one.", "words": [{"w": "Here", "s": 124.29}, {"w": "you’ve", "s": 124.68}, {"w": "got", "s": 125.06}, {"w": "a", "s": 125.45}, {"w": "photo,", "s": 125.83}, {"w": "a", "s": 126.22}, {"w": "bottle", "s": 126.6}, {"w": "and", "s": 126.98}, {"w": "a", "s": 127.37}, {"w": "room,", "s": 127.75}, {"w": "and", "s": 128.14}, {"w": "each", "s": 128.52}, {"w": "takes", "s": 128.91}, {"w": "a", "s": 129.29}, {"w": "different", "s": 129.68}, {"w": "one.", "s": 130.06}]}, {"start": 130.8, "end": 135.03, "text": "You basically have to learn the classifier along with the noun.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 130.8}, {"w": "basically", "s": 131.18}, {"w": "have", "s": 131.57}, {"w": "to", "s": 131.95}, {"w": "learn", "s": 132.33}, {"w": "the", "s": 132.72}, {"w": "classifier", "s": 133.1}, {"w": "along", "s": 133.49}, {"w": "with", "s": 133.87}, {"w": "the", "s": 134.26}, {"w": "noun.", "s": 134.64}]}, {"start": 135.38, "end": 137.68, "text": "So Chinese has plenty of grammar.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 135.38}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 135.76}, {"w": "has", "s": 136.15}, {"w": "plenty", "s": 136.53}, {"w": "of", "s": 136.92}, {"w": "grammar.", "s": 137.3}]}, {"start": 138.03, "end": 143.8, "text": "It’s just moved out of the word endings and into the vocabulary and the sentence.", "words": [{"w": "It’s", "s": 138.03}, {"w": "just", "s": 138.42}, {"w": "moved", "s": 138.8}, {"w": "out", "s": 139.19}, {"w": "of", "s": 139.57}, {"w": "the", "s": 139.96}, {"w": "word", "s": 140.34}, {"w": "endings", "s": 140.73}, {"w": "and", "s": 141.11}, {"w": "into", "s": 141.5}, {"w": "the", "s": 141.88}, {"w": "vocabulary", "s": 142.27}, {"w": "and", "s": 142.65}, {"w": "the", "s": 143.03}, {"w": "sentence.", "s": 143.42}]}, {"start": 144.15, "end": 146.46, "text": "Writing is a different story altogether.", "words": [{"w": "Writing", "s": 144.15}, {"w": "is", "s": 144.54}, {"w": "a", "s": 144.92}, {"w": "different", "s": 145.31}, {"w": "story", "s": 145.69}, {"w": "altogether.", "s": 146.08}]}, {"start": 146.81, "end": 150.27, "text": "For Chinese, it’s a whole track of its own.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 146.81}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 147.2}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 147.58}, {"w": "a", "s": 147.97}, {"w": "whole", "s": 148.35}, {"w": "track", "s": 148.73}, {"w": "of", "s": 149.12}, {"w": "its", "s": 149.5}, {"w": "own.", "s": 149.89}]}, {"start": 150.62, "end": 158.32, "text": "But some languages, including many Indigenous languages, are learned mostly by listening, so they have few script goals, or none.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 150.62}, {"w": "some", "s": 151.01}, {"w": "languages,", "s": 151.39}, {"w": "including", "s": 151.78}, {"w": "many", "s": 152.16}, {"w": "Indigenous", "s": 152.55}, {"w": "languages,", "s": 152.93}, {"w": "are", "s": 153.32}, {"w": "learned", "s": 153.7}, {"w": "mostly", "s": 154.08}, {"w": "by", "s": 154.47}, {"w": "listening,", "s": 154.85}, {"w": "so", "s": 155.24}, {"w": "they", "s": 155.62}, {"w": "have", "s": 156.01}, {"w": "few", "s": 156.39}, {"w": "script", "s": 156.78}, {"w": "goals,", "s": 157.16}, {"w": "or", "s": 157.55}, {"w": "none.", "s": 157.93}]}]}